WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.544
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.544 --> 00:00:05.444
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:08.944
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:08.944 --> 00:00:09.264
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.264 --> 00:00:12.553
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.553 --> 00:00:16.242
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:27.495
Write the training-versus-inference comparison.

00:00:27.495 --> 00:00:33.522
Reveal the first model answer.

00:00:33.522 --> 00:00:37.883
Self-score the first answer as complete.

00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:48.374
Write the explanation about a prompt definition.

00:00:48.374 --> 00:00:51.667
Reveal the second model answer.

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:57.654
Review and self-score the prompt explanation.

00:00:57.654 --> 00:01:10.256
Write the retrieval explanation with its limitation.

00:01:10.256 --> 00:01:16.223
Reveal the third model answer and its two criteria.

00:01:16.223 --> 00:01:20.592
Self-award two points to the completed retrieval explanation.

00:01:20.592 --> 00:01:26.448
Inspect the complete worksheet and 6/6 total.

00:01:26.448 --> 00:01:33.813
Reset the worksheet answers, reveals and scores.
